ckson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","review_id":"bsSZPtQ3IOtiTBBG2wgyYg","date":"2019-08-27T18:47:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.942028284072876,"text_excerpt":"Really love this new space; atmosphere is beautiful. Wished I lived to closer to enjoy date night here more often. Overall the food was very good. Service was a bit slow at times, but even the manger came by to check on us so overall great service. They really are trying to provide a more traditional tapas menu with their own twist. We wanted to stick to a bit of traditional and a bit of local. I can honestly say I recommend all of these dishes: Gambas Al Ajillo, Papas Bravas, Octopus, and Scallops. We also really appreciated their wine list. The prices of the wine by the glass allowed us to have a few different wines at the table as we tasted through their menu - a white, rose, and red -..."},{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","review_id":"bPE2Ek0qcO2jyQIGtS-5lA","date":"2019-06-05T02:45:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409486055374146,"text_excerpt":"I was unsuspectedly blown away with how GOOD the food was on my visit. Like really good! Started off with the Costera Gin & Tonic. I detest gin, but LOVE a G&T because of the magic of chemistry, and this one did not disappoint!! Grapefruit lime & mint were so light and refreshing in here. It's a huge glass too. So worth it. My taste buds were pretty happy to start off. We did about 5 tapas plates to share between 2 ppl, plus dessert and drinks and we left FULL. The tapas are a decent size for what one would expect for tapas. We got the Jamon Ibérico because you have to in a Spanish restaurant and it was delicious as cured leg of meat should be! It was followed by a fantastic little bowl o..."},{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","review_id":"HwPNyy46wB3puY_thR4mSw","date":"2019-02-11T17:39:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.93596351146698,"text_excerpt":"I visited Costera this past weekend with my fiance and a few friends. We had a reservation for 6:45 and were seated promptly. The space is the same layout as La Thai, but they have created a more rustic and warm environment with the decor. We started with a great bottle of Spanish wine. They have an excellent wine list from the Iberian Peninsula and also an extensive French section. After our first bottle, my fiance wanted to switch wine and the manager was very helpful in finding him a wine that matched his preferences. The food was divine. I'm gluten free and had tons of options. We started with the blistered shishito peppers, mushroom toast, lamb sweetbreads, and the beets. The peppers..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","photo_id":"MKN-nqSKdgFFu0pIko1TNg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MKN-nqSKdgFFu0pIko1TNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9505188465118408},{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","photo_id":"4X_se2E4EOKlrVm5Hyjxng","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4X_se2E4EOKlrVm5Hyjxng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.899375319480896},{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","photo_id":"-LBSfJdCAorcbhlRE9pHkw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-LBSfJdCAorcbhlRE9pHkw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8746554851531982},{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","photo_id":"VwcbD2I3S3j9BSG52kSZUg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/VwcbD2I3S3j9BSG52kSZUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8039615154266357},{"business_id":"_dtlumMepOrZx-k1JEwgWA","photo_id":"